 "premise": "Far in the future, humanity lives in a vast ring above an Earth left to recover, stratified so that the higher the floor, the higher the status (VIZ blurb). Mitsu, a 14-year-old from the lowest level, takes up his late father's job as an exterior window washer, working with his father's colleagues and glimpsing the lives of upper-floor clients (Manga Bookshelf review). Won the Japan Media Arts Festival Grand Prize (MangaUpdates).",
